From e9ce4410712f526d4ac627298d3a549b9892fe1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bakhodirovxz <bohodirovasadbek1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:30:21 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] pdf: embed TrueType subsets with Identity-H and ToUnicode

The writer could only use the 14 standard fonts, so Cyrillic and other
non-Latin text exported as '?'. Faces registered with register_face are
subset per document, written as CID fonts with a ToUnicode map, measured
with their own advance widths and fall back per character to another
registered face. Adds a bounds-checked TrueType reader (cmap 4/12, hmtx,
glyf subsetting) and text_width_snapped for Excel's pixel-snapped widths.
